abstract: "A self-hosted web application for browsing, searching and annotating a virtual microscopy slide archive, designed as a companion to OMERO rather than a replacement. Written to recover the University of Glasgow's MVLS virtual microscopy archive after its original SlidePath / Digital Image Hub management system was discontinued, and released for other institutions holding collections stranded in the same way."
keywords:
  - OMERO
  - "virtual microscopy"
  - "whole-slide imaging"
  - "digital pathology"
  - histology
  - DICOM
  - SlidePath
  - "legacy data recovery"
  - "dental education"
  - "veterinary education"
  - "research data management"
